WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.665
Where they all are tonight.

00:02.365 --> 00:05.833
This is the Solar System from above, as it is tonight.

00:06.283 --> 00:09.866
Each dot is a planet at its true place on its path.

00:10.316 --> 00:18.392
Which ones you can see depends on where the Earth is among them: a planet on the far side of the Sun from us is lost in its glare.
